  <prompt>Retire sprk_invoicestatus (D-41, FR-06): migrate its values to statuscode, move every reader and writer to statuscode (counted spend = In Review, Approved, Sent to AP, Paid, filtered on statuscode), remove it from forms, views and docs, then — with owner OK — drop the column and the global option set in dev. Notify ontology-r1 when the PR opens; ontology-r1 reviews the ontology-owned files. Runs in the main session (one .claude/ edit).</prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Expert in BFF Finance code, FetchXML, Dataverse solution source and cross-project coordination.</role>

  <goal>grep -ri sprk_invoicestatus over src, tests, scripts, config, docs and .claude finds nothing (except history notes under projects/); FinanceBaseValues.CountedInvoiceStatuses holds the four statuscode values and its FetchXML / QueryExpression filter on statuscode; all listed tests pass; the column and option set no longer exist in dev; ontology-r1 has been notified and has reviewed the ontology-owned files.</goal>

