  <steps mode="prescriptive">
    <step order="0">git merge-base --is-ancestor f292ad119 HEAD; if it fails, merge origin/master first.</step>
    <step order="1">Re-run grep -ri for sprk_invoicestatus, InvoiceStatusReviewed, CountedInvoiceStatuses, InvoiceStatusToReview, InvInvoiceStatus and invoiceStatus over src, tests, scripts, config, docs, .claude, .github; reconcile with the inventory; record differences.</step>
    <step order="2">Dev data: count invoices by sprk_invoicestatus and statecode / statuscode; migrate any row not already In Review per FR-06 (ToReview → In Review, Reviewed → In Review) through a script that logs ids; record counts.</step>
    <step order="3">Change FinanceBaseValues, FinanceRollupService and their tests / seam test / ArchTest; then FinanceSummaryService, InvoiceReviewService, FinancialCalculationToolHandler, InvoiceLiveFactResolver, ExternalAccessModule and their tests; then the SPA files and tests.</step>
    <step order="4">dotnet build; dotnet test (unit, ArchTests, the listed integration tests); npm test in src/client/external-spa.</step>
    <step order="5">Dev: remove the column from the main and quick-create forms and the two views; publish. Present the drop plan to the owner and STOP for an explicit OK.</step>
    <step order="6">After the OK: delete the sprk_invoicestatus column, then the global option set, in dev; publish; verify 404 on both.</step>
    <step order="7">Update solution source to match dev (the listed SpaarkeMaster files; delete OptionSets/sprk_invoicestatus.xml) and round-trip with scripts/Import-SolutionScoped.ps1 against dev.</step>
    <step order="8">Update the docs; main session updates ACT-004.json.</step>
    <step order="9">Measure publish-size delta. Open the PR listing every reader above; notify ontology-r1 (PR link) and record the notification and their review in task notes.</step>
    <step order="10">Update TASK-INDEX.md: change this task's status cell to ✅ [done].</step>
    <step order="11">If any deviations from plan, document in projects/ebilling-r1/notes/.</step>
  </steps>

