  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">grep -ri sprk_invoicestatus over src, tests, scripts, config, docs, .claude and .github returns nothing.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">FinanceBaseValues.CountedInvoiceStatuses equals the four statuscode values In Review, Approved, Sent to AP, Paid; the rollup query and FetchXML filter on statuscode; a Paid (Inactive) invoice is counted and a Rejected / Returned to Firm / Cancelled one is not (unit test and the live seam test).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">FinanceBaseValuesSingleDefinitionGuardTests passes and its control still fires on a private copy of the new values.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">FinancialCalculationToolHandler and InvoiceLiveFactResolver read statuscode (and sprk_totalamount) — tests show a real status value reaches their output.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">A newly created invoice gets statuscode In Review and no sprk_invoicestatus write (InvoiceReviewWritePathTests updated and passing).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">In dev, the sprk_invoicestatus column and option set return 404, after an owner OK recorded with date; data-migration counts recorded.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Import-SolutionScoped.ps1 round trip against dev succeeds with the updated solution source.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">ontology-r1 notified at PR open and its review of the ontology-owned files recorded; PR lists every reader in the inventory.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Publish-size delta measured against a fresh master build and recorded; no new HIGH CVE; dotnet test and the external SPA tests pass.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Cover the stated contract plus the edge cases named above. Anything beyond that needs a one-line justification in task notes.</criterion>
